From 80466ea353e9d7893c6ea266cb56c3b3a9495db2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dooset22 <dooset22@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 09:05:32 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Add Xbox Series X|S Developer Mode (UWP) build

Builds against a UWP build of the ReXGlue SDK (REXGLUE_UWP):

- UWP entry point and rexglue_uwp_app() packaging; rb2_package target
  builds a signed .msix, optionally including the game files
  (RB2_UWP_GAME_FILES)
- Game files from LocalState/assets take priority over packaged ones
- Saves and user data in LocalState/rb2 instead of Documents
- dlmalloc uses VirtualAllocFromApp in the app container
- uwp-amd64-* presets (REXSDK_UWP) and README instructions

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01T2Eqt3AmpbNRB9dC5uwqee
