 CMakePresets.json              | 21 +++++++++++++++++++++
 README.md                      | 25 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/bdengine/bd_init.h         |  3 ++-
 src/bdengine/file_hooks.cpp    | 18 ++++++++++++++++--
 src/main.cpp                   | 19 +++++++++++++++++++
